1
00:00:11,856 --> 00:00:14,228
Tu as des œufs ?
Do you have any eggs?

2
00:00:14,328 --> 00:00:19,364
Oui, j'en ai six. Combien t'en faut ?
Yes, I have six. How many do you need?

3
00:00:19,464 --> 00:00:24,356
Il m'en faut trois. Tu as aussi du sucre ?
I need three. Do you also have some sugar?

4
00:00:24,456 --> 00:00:31,052
J'en ai un peu, mais je n'en ai pas beaucoup. Prends-en deux cuillères.
I have a little, but not a lot. Take two spoonfuls.

5
00:00:31,152 --> 00:00:33,572
Et du beurre ?
And some butter?

6
00:00:33,672 --> 00:00:38,924
Il n'y en a plus. Je vais en acheter ce soir.
There's none left. I'm going to buy some tonight.
